{#- What to run next, from the stages recorded in the manifest. -#}
{%- set stages = __release_manifest.stages -%}
{%- set results = (__release_manifest.details.tested.results | default({})).values() | list -%}
{%- if 'released' in stages -%}
Done. The next release starts with: just download
{%- elif 'tested' in stages and results | length > 0 and results | rejectattr('passed') | list | length == 0 -%}
just release
{%- elif 'tested' in stages -%}
Fix the failures in {{ release_test_report }}, then: just test
{%- elif 'staged' in stages -%}
Build the test VMs (or: just provision), add them to the inventory, then: just bootstrap, then: just test
{%- else -%}
just stage
{%- endif -%}
